{"symbol":"JONJUA","yahoo":"JONJUA.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Jonjua Overseas Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Business Services","website":"https://www.jonjua.com","about":"Jonjua Overseas Limited engages in the service exports, corporate consultancy, and agriculture businesses. The company provides legal support services, such as draft documents for summons, complaints, answers, motions, and other proceeding; perform legal research using internet search engines and legal databases; draft case summaries; gather and organize legal evidence; draft legal documents, such as pleadings, legal responses, affidavits, position statements, contracts, and briefs; develop and implement legal strategies and solutions; tax planning and tax return preparation; document review; drafting of intellectual property rights applications, terms of use, disclaimer and privacy policy for websites, and bankruptcy documents; writing legal articles; preparation of accounts; and study medico-legal documents. It also offers outsourced services, including bookkeeping, payroll accounting, inventory accounting, cash flow and budgeting, accounts reconciliation, tax return preparation, and allied services; and trading of securities. In addition, the company publishes and sells aviation and offers e-books comprising technical and legal data related to the aviation and aviation engineering fields; sale of water for agricultural irrigation; sale of printed books; and sale and purchase of intangible goods, unlisted shares, and reviving companies under insolvency. Jonjua Overseas Limited was incorporated in 1993 and is based in Mohali, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:32:57+00:00","quote":{"price":3.14,"prevClose":3.03,"marketCap":11.06,"high52":6.4,"low52":1.94,"pe":1.37,"bookValue":14.7,"dividendRate":0.07,"roe":null,"shares":3.5234,"insiders":46.62,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2019-02-25","2019-02-26","2019-02-27","2019-02-28","2019-03-01","2019-03-05","2019-03-